Artwork Scraper 0.8.0

Author: Jose Diaz-Gonzalez (josegonzalez)
https://github.com/josegonzalez/minui-artwork-scraper-pak
License: MIT (see LICENSE in this pak)

Shipped from the upstream 0.8.0 release zip
(Artwork.Scraper.pak.zip). TrimUI-only binaries (tg5040/tg5050)
and 32-bit jq were removed; this image is aarch64 my355.

minui-list and minui-presenter under bin/my355/ are rebuilt against
this tree's NextUI my355 platform (joystick JOY_* plus keyboard),
not the upstream keyboard-only Flip build.
